3.5.4-gp9-live-scheduler
- Baseline: 3.5.4-gp8-archive-trace.
- Preserved gp8 decoder, checksum, EPIPE/reopen and stream-resync behavior.
- Replaced 15 s blocking interrupt reads with 2 s scheduling slices.
- Preserved logical timeout accounting at 15 s of continuous silence.
- Added heartbeat request/dispatch latency and USB lock-wait trace fields.
- Added explicit LIVE/ARCHIVE protocol mode state.
- D1 requests archive data only during startup archive recovery.
- D2 received in LIVE no longer requests additional archive records.
- D2 received in LIVE is traced and not retained in PacketArchive.pkt_queue.
- Static packet queues are cleared on driver instance startup.
- Diagnostic logs remain limited to 10 MB + 4 backups each.

3.5.4-gp8-archive-trace
- Added structured startup archive recovery diagnostics and gap accounting.
- Added asynchronous rotating driver_file_log.
- Sub-minute archive anomalies are dropped without aborting recovery.
